						kit.start(app, element, {
							node_ids: [0, 14, 48],
							data: [{type:"data",data:{theme:void 0},uses:{}},{type:"data",data:{isPublic:true,csrf:".eJwFwdsOQzAAANB_8b7EtXjE3LZRrA3z0jSkY7oZ6Yq_3zlKmA3HWDWjeksbCSU32uisWZBMOlw7jPku_L1tF7IkiMbu5kYVwEz0vjZt3xivNUhMneEDIM4QCCQdqJ2fStUgXlrYVATt5YmmwHvXDxu8GqgxgZ0hlk6R6akXXvOPS8y8lNxf7NrSRVTNEaF8rrLA13p4T9W-cFiHmt-8KX9f6jiA.g41bTV0JBdS6pFFwZ9XOr6v9rNc",user:void 0,menu:[{label:"Getting started",pages:[{href:"/documentation/quickstart",label:"Quickstart"},{href:"/documentation/playground",label:"Playground"},{href:"/documentation/pricing",label:"Pricing"}]},{label:"AI Search",pages:[{label:"LLM Context",subtitle:"Web search for AI agents",href:"/documentation/services/llm-context"},{label:"Answers",subtitle:"AI-generated cited answers",href:"/documentation/services/answers"}]},{label:"Specialized search",pages:[{label:"Web Search",subtitle:"Results pages for humans",href:"/documentation/services/web-search"},{href:"/documentation/services/news-search",label:"News search"},{href:"/documentation/services/video-search",label:"Video search"},{href:"/documentation/services/image-search",label:"Image search"},{href:"/documentation/services/place-search",label:"Place search"},{href:"/documentation/services/suggest",label:"Autosuggest"},{href:"/documentation/services/spellcheck",label:"Spellcheck"}]},{label:"Guides",pages:[{href:"/documentation/guides/authentication",label:"Authentication"},{href:"/documentation/guides/versioning",label:"Versioning"},{href:"/documentation/guides/rate-limiting",label:"Rate limiting"}]},{label:"Resources",pages:[{href:"/documentation/resources/skills",label:"Skills"},{href:"/documentation/resources/help-feedback",label:"Help & Feedback"},{href:"/documentation/resources/goggles",label:"Goggles"},{href:"/documentation/resources/search-operators",label:"Search operators"},{href:"/documentation/resources/status-updates",label:"Status updates"},{href:"/documentation/resources/security",label:"Security"},{href:"/documentation/resources/privacy-notice",label:"Privacy notice"},{href:"/documentation/resources/terms-of-service",label:"Terms of service"}]}],section:"Documentation",pageHeadings:[{id:"which-search",text:"Which search?",level:2},{id:"search-for-information",text:"Search for information",level:3},{id:"search-for-specialized-content",text:"Search for specialized content",level:3},{id:"ai-powered-features",text:"AI-Powered Features",level:3},{id:"why-brave-search-api",text:"Why Brave Search API?",level:2},{id:"ready-to-get-started",text:"Ready to get started?",level:2}],markdownContent:"# Brave Search API\n\nPrivacy-first search infrastructure for developers\n\nThe Brave Search API gives you access to the same powerful, independent search index that powers Brave Search - the privacy-first search engine trusted by millions. Built from the ground up without relying on Google or Bing, our API delivers unbiased, high-quality search results for your applications.\n\nWith comprehensive coverage across web search, news, images, videos, and advanced AI capabilities, the Brave Search API provides everything you need to build privacy-respecting search experiences.\n\n## Get started\n\nGet your API key and make your first request in minutes.\n\n## Which search?\n\nChoose the right search API for your use case to access our comprehensive search index.\n\n### Search for information\n\nClassic web search in two flavors, for *agents* and *humans*.\n\n#### LLM Context\n\nSearch for *AI agents*. Pre-extracted page content for your LLM — no scraping, token-budgeted. This is the default for RAG, tools, and chatbots.\n\n#### Web Search\n\nSearch for *humans*. Ranked titles, URLs, and short snippets for a results page, plus local and rich enrichments.\n\n### Search for specialized content\n\nUse specialized APIs for dedicated content, like news, images, videos, and places.\n\n#### News Search\n\nGet real-time news articles from thousands of trusted sources worldwide.\n\n#### Image Search\n\nSearch through billions of images with advanced filtering and SafeSearch options.\n\n#### Videos Search\n\nFind video content from across the web with metadata and thumbnails.\n\n#### Place Search\n\nFind geographic places — businesses, landmarks, POIs, cities, addresses, and more.\n\n### AI-Powered Features\n\nEnhance your applications with advanced AI capabilities.\n\n#### Answers\n\nAI-generated answers backed by real-time web search and verifiable sources.\n\n## Why Brave Search API?\n\n### Independent Index\n\nOur own search index means no dependence on Big Tech and no hidden biases.\n\n### Privacy-First\n\nBuilt with privacy at the core. No user tracking or profiling.\n\n### High Quality\n\nComprehensive coverage with billions of pages indexed and updated in real-time.\n\n### Rich Results\n\nEnhanced results with local information, knowledge graphs, and structured data.\n\n### Flexible Plans\n\nScalable plans to meet your needs, from small projects to enterprise solutions.\n\n### Fast & Reliable\n\nBest-in-class latencies and 99.9% uptime.\n\n## Ready to get started?\n\n### API Reference\n\nExplore our complete API reference with interactive examples.",pageType:"narrow",skillHref:void 0,actions:[{href:"/documentation",label:"Documentation"},{href:"/api-reference/ai/llm_context/get",label:"API Reference"}],title:"Documentation - Brave Search API",primaryAction:{href:"/login",label:"Log in",newTab:true}},uses:{route:1,url:1}},null],
							form: null,
